00:04:12.915 --> 00:04:15.165
who I do not recognize and an infant.

00:04:15.464 --> 00:04:17.445
They're sitting with strangers

00:04:20.115 --> 00:04:21.615
and I'm thinking, how am I

00:04:21.615 --> 00:04:23.355
going to solve this problem?

00:04:23.355 --> 00:04:25.185
But Clara knows what I'm gonna do

00:04:25.185 --> 00:04:26.925
because she says, it's okay, dad.

00:04:27.075 --> 00:04:27.974
She said, we can sit

00:04:27.974 --> 00:04:28.905
