00:04:28.905 --> 00:04:29.925
This is Hannah, and she

00:04:29.925 --> 00:04:30.914
points to the infant.

00:04:32.715 --> 00:04:33.554
And so I look at the

00:04:33.554 --> 00:04:34.844
woman and she looks at me.

00:04:34.844 --> 00:04:36.554
She gives me that sign that, I know

00:04:36.554 --> 00:04:38.354
this is ridiculous, but let's do this.

00:04:38.685 --> 00:04:40.755
And so I sit down with a stranger

00:04:40.755 --> 00:04:44.265
at Panera, and Clara introduces me

00:04:44.265 --> 00:04:46.094
to them, and we make some chitchat.

00:04:46.395 --> 00:04:47.685
And then she asks the woman, she

00:04:47.685 --> 00:04:49.424
says, where's Hannah's daddy today?

00:04:49.424 --> 00:04:50.385
And the woman says, oh,

00:04:50.414 --> 00:04:51.705
Hannah doesn't have a daddy.

00:04:52.094 --> 00:04:52.695
And my wife.

00:04:52.695 --> 00:04:54.734
And, and Clara says, oh, is it,

00:04:54.794 --> 00:04:56.414
are you a mommy, mommy family?

00:04:56.745 --> 00:04:59.505
And she says, no, it's just Hannah and me.

00:05:00.525 --> 00:05:02.055
That's the moment when I look at this

00:05:02.055 --> 00:05:03.855
woman for the first time and I really

00:05:03.855 --> 00:05:06.795
see her and I see the bags under her eyes

00:05:06.795 --> 00:05:08.595
