00:05:18.165 --> 00:05:20.715
The pacifiers and the bottles.

00:05:20.715 --> 00:05:22.935
All stuff that I haven't seen in a

00:05:22.935 --> 00:05:24.885
little while because my kids are older.

00:05:25.305 --> 00:05:26.055
It's the first time I

00:05:26.055 --> 00:05:27.795
really see this woman.

00:05:28.155 --> 00:05:29.895
Who's taking care of this baby and

00:05:29.985 --> 00:05:33.525
all of this stuff by herself and.

00:05:34.170 --> 00:05:36.420
I'm so angry at Clara because she

00:05:36.420 --> 00:05:38.370
