00:05:42.210 --> 00:05:43.860
'cause my wife left with me, with my

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:47.460
kids for three hours, three stupid

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:50.160
hours that I am complaining about.

00:05:50.430 --> 00:05:52.200
I remember when Clara was born, I thought

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:54.840
