00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:57.540
And this woman is doing it

00:05:57.540 --> 00:06:00.150
on her own and she's smiling.

00:06:00.705 --> 00:06:02.955
She's chatting with my daughter in a way.

00:06:02.955 --> 00:06:06.135
I have not chatted with her all day, and

00:06:06.135 --> 00:06:10.335
I sit there with these two brilliant beams

00:06:10.335 --> 00:06:13.815
